<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1837" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄζυξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠγος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζεύγνυμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unyoked, unpaired</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				157
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάμαλις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					1.40
				</span></i>
			; <i>unmarried</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				694
			</span></i>; of Pallas, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				536
			</span></i> (lyr.): c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. λέκτρων,
				γάμων, εὐνῆς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				546
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IA</u>
				805
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Med.</u>
				673
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>isolated</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ὥσπερ ἐν πεττοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1253a7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.482.26
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); <i>single</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλοί</span>,
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύριγγες</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				3.76
			</span></i>: in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄζυγα</span>
			<i>vowels</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύζυγα</span>,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.262
			</span></i>.</div>
